{
  "entries": [
    {
      "offset": "0x2e1ade",
      "back_en": "Hey, Oshtor.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exact."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e1b33",
      "back_en": "Vurai...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Name kept."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e1b68",
      "back_en": "his answer quiet and simple.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e1b85",
      "back_en": "We do not fight him.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e1b9a",
      "back_en": "Yet I am afraid that may be unavoidable...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e1c9a",
      "back_en": "nothing to add.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragment, fits 'nothing further to add'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e1df0",
      "back_en": "I'm afraid not.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e1e30",
      "back_en": "no way of stopping that man.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Lost 'sure' (no sure way) -> 'sem forma segura'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e1e84",
      "back_en": "consumed by his flames... Reduced to ash.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e1f34",
      "back_en": "have... the slimmest of chances.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e202d",
      "back_en": "Um... So does that mean...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e21a8",
      "back_en": "be removed.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragment, fine."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e21e4",
      "back_en": "It requires that the wielder focus their mind.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e2245",
      "back_en": "defenseless.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'indefeso' close to vulnerable."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e2281",
      "back_en": "even defend himself. A golden opportunity.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e2357",
      "back_en": "strongest in all Yamato.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e23d0",
      "back_en": "I would not say that it is... impossible...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e241c",
      "back_en": "Excuse me, brother...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e2494",
      "back_en": "we'll vanish suddenly...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragment 'right out' rendered as 'de repente', acceptable."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e24a1",
      "back_en": "...We will all be vaporized where we stand.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e251f",
      "back_en": "a cold glare his way.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e259e",
      "back_en": "...Wait, don't tell me you intend on fighting him",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e2742",
      "back_en": "You'd only get in the way in that case.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Sense preserved, plural addressing."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e2770",
      "back_en": "And besides, they've still got your mask,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e2a3b",
      "back_en": "An Akuruturuka, just like Oshtor...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e2e2d",
      "back_en": "You could be an owlo, should you wish it.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e3a3e",
      "back_en": "You may leave that role to us.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e3a66",
      "back_en": "We are the Kamunagi of Chains.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e3a85",
      "back_en": "We have the means to subdue those who wield weapons against",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'bare their...' rendered as wield weapons, fits cut sentence."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e3ace",
      "back_en": "You do?",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'Você faz?' is literal/wrong; should be 'Vocês têm?' (referring to means)."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e3b2d",
      "back_en": "They say they're able to seal away any who",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e3bd6",
      "back_en": "These two are the Kamunagi of Chains, and?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e3c5b",
      "back_en": "calamities.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e3e19",
      "back_en": "the Ohn Riyaak.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e3e29",
      "back_en": "Ohn Riyaak... Is that...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e3e70",
      "back_en": "...How did Yamato get ahold of it...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e3ec3",
      "back_en": "Vurai?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Name kept."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e3eca",
      "back_en": "We shall execute your wish without fail.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e404f",
      "back_en": "No other option.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalent to 'no other way'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e40b7",
      "back_en": "the two of us.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'os dois de nós' awkward; should be 'nós dois'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e40c2",
      "back_en": "Please. Give us the order.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e417c",
      "back_en": "Without fail.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e418a",
      "back_en": "We shall seal him once and for all.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e425a",
      "back_en": "Even if that means they'll...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e431e",
      "back_en": "Please... save... Her Highness...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'a Alteza' slightly informal but fine."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e2465",
      "back_en": "Ugh, I was deliberately avoiding asking that",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e24f2",
      "back_en": "Kiwru's shoulders slump as Nekone shoots a",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e294f",
      "back_en": "And here I was almost impressed by your words...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e2d74",
      "back_en": "And you'd better have a nice fat reward waiting for me!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Adds 'for me' but sense preserved."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e2dd2",
      "back_en": "Oh? Mere reward...? If you save Her Highness,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e2ef6",
      "back_en": "for a little while.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e32b6",
      "back_en": "Kiwru... courage is already within your grasp.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e3494",
      "back_en": "'Cause if I ran, I'd never sleep well at night",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'if I did' contextualized as fleeing, fine."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e34f9",
      "back_en": "Nobody'd judge me for running now, but if I ran,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e3b5f",
      "back_en": "become a threat to the imperial capital.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e3b88",
      "back_en": "Are the rumors true, then...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e3e96",
      "back_en": "So you two are saying you can take care of",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2e4142",
      "back_en": "...You guys sure you can pull it off?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    }
  ],
  "reviewed": 58
}